From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Derek Ross <derekross@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:04:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: samsung: exynos-sysreg: add gs201 VGPIO2AP

The VGPIO2AP system registers of gs201 turn the main PMIC's in-band
interrupt into a level interrupt with a pending latch that the host must
clear. They have no clock of their own.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml   | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
index 0fb2197f8..f4254521b 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/samsung/samsung,exynos-sysreg.yaml
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ properties:
               - google,gs101-peric1-sysreg
               - google,gs201-hsi2-sysreg
               - google,gs201-peric1-sysreg
+              - google,gs201-vgpio2ap-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos2200-cmgp-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos2200-peric0-sysreg
               - samsung,exynos2200-peric1-sysreg
